[0.002, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.131, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J Back Alley, noon\u001b[1;80HGoals: 1  Score: 0\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(0\u001b[0mqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqq\u001b(B\u001b[7;1H\u001b(0\u001b[0m"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(BCan you hear me? >> "]
[1.864, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1my\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ms\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.107, "o", "\r\u001b[9dGood, you're conscious. We're conscious. I've heard urban legends about synthesis going wrong, one\r\u001b[10dhalf person getting lost.\r\u001b[12d"]
[0.000, "o", "Do you remember our name?\r\u001b[14d>"]
[2.405, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.101, "o", "\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "To review, we're Alexandra now. I was Alex, before the synthesis. You were...\r\u001b[17d>"]
[2.405, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mA\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1md\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ma\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.100, "o", "\r\u001b[18d...yes! Okay. We're both here, neither of us lost our minds in the synthesis process. As far as I\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "can tell, the operation was a success. We're meant to be one person now, unrecognizable to anyone\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "who knew us before.\r\u001b[22d"]
[3.008, "o", "\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[3M\u001b[19d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mCounterfeit Monkey\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mA Removal by Emily Short\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "Release 10 / Serial number 210312 / Inform 7 build 6M62 (I6/v6.34 lib 6/12N)\r\u001b[24dLet's try to get a look around. I haven't been able to run our body without your help, but maybe now\u001b[25;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "you're awake, it'll work better.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "To get a look around, type LOOK and press return. If you do not want help getting started, type\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "TUTORIAL OFF.\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.525, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ml\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mk\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.109, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[10M\u001b[20d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mBack Alley\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mThis isn't much, is it? Just the back sides of a couple of buildings, some peeling yellow paint, and\u001b[22;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "not even much by way of windows to look in through. I think the place where we had the procedure\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "done is just a block or two away, but I've already lost the door. I imagine they change it.\r\u001b[25dThis alley runs north to the open street, towards the town square. That's the way we'll want to go\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "first.\r\u001b[28dYou can find out more if you LOOK AT THE YELLOW BUILDINGS (or shorten it to L YELLOW BUILDINGS).\r\u001b[29d>"]
[3.186, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mx\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m \u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m-\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mm\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mv\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.110, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[12M\u001b[18dIt is a blunt-nosed plastic device, about the size of a laser pointer, that can be waved at things\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "to remove excess Rs. It is not very powerful, and often fails against large items. On the other\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "hand, it has a wide range of action: it can be set to any letter we choose.\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "These are, if not exactly cheap, hardly unknown in Atlantis.\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "Something makes you think of how we got here.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "[MEMORIES will list your currently active memories]\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "There are other things around here that you can look at too, if you like. You can check out other\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "things in your surroundings, or LOOK AT ME to see yourself.\r\u001b[29d>"]
[3.186, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mt\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mh\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.110, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[14M\u001b[H "]
[0.000, "o", "Sigil Street, noon\r\u001b[17d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mSigil Street\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mThe buildings here are two and three stories, with shops at ground level and elderly apartments\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "above. The shops are closed for the holiday: a typographer's office, tourist boutiques of colorful\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "skirts and ethnic bodices (rarely if ever worn by natives) and t-shirts covered with font designs.\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "Passing by the reflective window we catch the sight of our single blended body, and it creeps me\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "out.\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "A narrow alley runs between buildings to the south, while the street continues east.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "There are other things around here that you can look at too, if you like. You can check out other\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "things in your surroundings, or LOOK AT ME to see yourself.\r\u001b[29d"]
[0.000, "o", ">"]
[3.186, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ma\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ms\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mt\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.130, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[13M\u001b[H "]
[0.000, "o", "Ampersand Bend, noon\r\u001b[18d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mAmpersand Bend\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mA bend in the street, which runs west and north. This district combines the old and the new: a small\u001b[20;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "museum in an ancient stone building to the east, a shiny real estate office south. The window of the\u001b[21;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "museum is currently displaying one of its exhibits, a codex.\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "A temporary barrier blocks this empty street from the busy fair to the north, though there is a door\u001b[24;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "that could be opened with the correct code. From here the gaiety and excitement of the holiday are\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "fairly loud.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "There are other things around here that you can look at too, if you like. You can check out other\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "things in your surroundings, or LOOK AT ME to see yourself.\r\u001b[29d"]
[0.000, "o", ">"]
[3.187, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mx\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m \u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mc\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1md\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mx\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.103, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[12M\u001b[18dA manuscript of Atlantean origin from the 16th century. It records a series of slightly mad visions\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "of what the world would be like if the \"composition of letters\" could be systematically exchanged.\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.001, "o", "At that time, the name-driven nature of the universe was not yet understood, but some consciousness\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "of it wiggled towards the surface like a breaking tooth. The lunatics were first to notice.\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "I've visited this museum before and seen the inside, by the way. Many of the pages are filled with\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "what we would now consider rather elementary rebus puzzles.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "There are other things around here that you can look at too, if you like. You can check out other\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "things in your surroundings, or LOOK AT ME to see yourself.\r\u001b[29d>"]
[3.216, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mq\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mu\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mi\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mt\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.100, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[M\u001b[29dAre you sure you want to quit? "]
[1.203, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1my\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[M\u001b[30d \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mHit any key to exit.\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
